{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/158512-what-do-they-mean-by-scion-s-moving-into-active-mode-for-2014","id":158512,"title":"What do they mean by \"Scion's moving into active mode for 2014\"","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Onyx Path Worlds","Scion"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-06-03T18:44:34-07:00","id":158512,"title":"What do they mean by \"Scion's moving into active mode for 2014\"","content":"Please don't hold it against me if this has been asked but going back to find old threads is haphazard at best!<br /> <br /> I was looking through the Monday Meetings notes from the last little while to see if they hinted at any progress in the development of Scion, and they all say &quot;Scion's moving into active mode for 2014&quot;. Does this mean anything other than work is gearing up on Scion? The book is still in the process of being written, it hasn't moved on to editing and approval right? I know the Onyx Path schedule has its release listed for august, but the schedual generally seems to be overly optimistic, and more importantly very very out of date. There's no chance the book is coming out in less than three months if it still being written right?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1522-turkeygiant","name":"turkeygiant","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1522_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"999"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-04T22:21:16-07:00","id":159759,"title":"","content":"From what I read, the art is being placed in for Origins. We'll just have to keep up with the Monday blurbs on the main page to see.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/891-jackalopevegas","name":"JackalopeVegas","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-04T22:23:33-07:00","id":159763,"title":"","content":"To reiterate, this is the latest info for Scion: Origins:<br /> <br /> <b>Scion:</b> Waiting or sketches for the <b>Scion: Origins </b>cover. New character piece coming in maybe this week.<br /> <br /> Again, look to Monday Meetings blurb on main Onyx Path page for info.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/891-jackalopevegas","name":"JackalopeVegas","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"246"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-04T22:39:21-07:00","id":159768,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JackalopeVegas</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/158512-what-do-they-mean-by-scion-s-moving-into-active-mode-for-2014?p=159763#post159763\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">To reiterate, this is the latest info for Scion: Origins:<br /> <br /> <b>Scion:</b> Waiting or sketches for the <b>Scion: Origins </b>cover. New character piece coming in maybe this week.<br /> <br /> Again, look to Monday Meetings blurb on main Onyx Path page for info.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> I think I have just gotten used to the play by play of what's being written that we get from the Exalted staff now. I was hoping that same sort of stuff existed out there somewhere for Scion, as its status seems to have been pretty much the same in the Monday Meeting notes for a least a couple months.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1522-turkeygiant","name":"turkeygiant","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1522_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"999"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-11T11:48:08-07:00","id":166138,"title":"","content":"There'll be more info as we get the system ready for external playtest. Right now, we're tweaking combat.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Cavaliers of Mars Creator</b><br /> <b>Retired CofD Lead</b><br /> <br /> Check out my <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Rose%20Bailey\" target=\"_blank\">guides to </a><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/261142/BITE-ME-How-to-Write-Vampire?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> and my <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse/pub/4895/Fantasy-Heartbreaker?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">indie games</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2-rose-bailey","name":"Rose Bailey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2361"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-06-11T15:31:26-07:00","id":166285,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Rose Bailey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/scion/158512-what-do-they-mean-by-scion-s-moving-into-active-mode-for-2014?p=166138#post166138\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">There'll be more info as we get the system ready for external playtest. Right now, we're tweaking combat.</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> That's great to Hear! Thanks for popping in to give us a update!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1522-turkeygiant","name":"turkeygiant","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1522_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"999"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}